      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Lyrics:\n\n[I used to rule the server\nRaiders when I hopped in game\nNow every server I get raided\nMade fun by newgens and those who know\nThey once were all in my clan \nStop to join every time I went online\nPeople building skycrapers\nFor the leader I was\nThat's what they preached\nOne minute I held the crown\nNext my clan its crashing down\nAway from all that raiding had once become\nI had left for votes now I stood there numb\nI Hear Discord alert pings a ringing\nValue on ranked is raiding\nGriefing on god for real\nCatch me trending on the discord servers\nI hope one day that this clan just dies\nAnd stops getting dragged forever\nNever a clan was made\nAs massive as Ruwblockia..]",
