      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Lyrics:\n\nWe're raiding every night\nTo finally raid and grief all night\nNewgens to play with us\nFor many years we've been all alone\n\nWe're forced to be still and raid\nThe same servers we've known since that day\nA mod took our accounts away\nNow we're stuck here to raid\n\nPlease let us raid!\nDon't ban us away!\nWe're not like what you're thinking\n\nWe're poor little clans\nWho have lost all control\nAnd we're forced here to take that role\n\nWe've been all alone\nStuck in our little clan\nSince 1987\n\nJoin us, be our member\nOr just be griefed and raided\nAfter all you only got\n\nFive nights at Ranked\nIs this where you wanna build?\nI just don't get it\nWhy do you want to build?\n\nFive nights at Ranked\nIs this where you wanna build?\nI just don't get it\nWhy do you want to build?\n\nFive nights at Ranked\n\nWe're really quite surprised\nWe get to see you in another server\nYou should have looked for another game\nYou should have said to this game good-bye\n\nIt's like there's so much more\nMaybe you've played this game before\nWe remember a spy like you\nYou seem acquainted with those clans\n\nPlease let us raid!\nDon't ban us away!\nWe're not like what you're thinking\n\nWe're poor little clans\nWho have lost all control\nAnd we're forced here to take that role\n\nWe've been all alone\nStuck in our little clan\nSince 1987\n\nJoin us, be our member\nOr just be griefed and raided\nAfter all you only got\n\nFive nights at Ranked \nIs this where you wanna build?\nI just don't get it\nWhy do you want to build?\n\nFive nights at Ranked\nIs this where you wanna build?\nI just don't get it\nWhy do you want to build?\n\nFive nights at Ranked",
