      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Lyrics: \n\nCoal! The fuel of powerful ships!\nThe thing that keeps our navy strong!\nSo, we mine, mine and mine Until the carts are full!\nCoal! The fuel of industries! Petroleum too!\nSo, we’ll stand with pick in hand! Until the carts filled!\nAnthracite and Lignite. And Subbituminous, \nBituminous, Peat as well! Coal! Coal! Coal!\nOh! The value that this coal brings! With a ton boosts the engines\nAnd with that we shall dominate and rule the oceans!",
