      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Lyrics:\n\nIn the heart of Roblox where we stand Saddamland so mighty so grand. With armies vast and horse so bold, our massive cities pure as gold.\n\nOur founder Saddam, great and true built a nation fresh and new. With strength and courage we all fight, in his name we claim our right. \n\nSaddamland! Saddamland! Pride and honour in our hands, with armies strong and cities wide, with his name we claim our right. \n\nSaddamland! Saddamland! Pride and honour in our hands, with armies strong and cities wide, we stand together side by side.\n\nThrough endless lands our power flows with unity our spirit grows. From desert fierce to mountains high, our colours brighten up the sky. From dawn to dusk, we sing his praise, Saddam the great who lights our days with battles won and peace at hand, we’ll always cherish our grand land. \n\nSaddamland! Saddamland! Pride and honour in our hands, with armies strong and cities wide we stand together side by side. \n\nFrom dawn to dusk we sing his praise, Saddam the great who lights our days with battles won and peace at hand, we’ll always cherish our grand land.",
